   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"fd5bd813-9fc9-c64c-ab08-246123d2332e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["17. What this notebook has established", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"27ab5bdc-f1a5-df43-a439-ca2b25e07d1c"],

Cell["This notebook has done the following:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"aeba1348-2985-704c-ba1d-6f9c6f9ddcbd"],

Cell["1. elevated measurement to a coequal role with dynamics,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5e74eb0b-e6aa-ef45-8c06-9008e927c1dc"],

Cell["2. defined a richer field state,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8d7cbbf6-5723-9242-8ab0-24d2f081e875"],

Cell["3. built an extended action functional,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6a7e77c1-2946-1541-acf6-8c342750e106"],

Cell["4. introduced closure and ratio-locking potentials,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"26de0374-6c79-a948-83f4-af110fb0571c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "5. specified how to derive equations with ",
 ButtonBox["EulerEquations",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->"paclet:ref/EulerEquations"],
 ","
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0d882eb3-3cb1-ad41-8bd8-72d03c0c7a1e"],

Cell["6. described linearization and eigenmode analysis,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ae5cfe40-bb1d-b44c-9134-65b0467d736a"],

Cell["7. formalized spherical and toroidal geometry terms,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fd9e4dbe-b65a-404f-9aa2-5e001cfc88d5"],

Cell["8. proposed a redesigned science of measurement.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a4ec89db-8615-cc44-928b-fc9c59ab5592"],

Cell["Its central thesis is: ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a2dc1f85-9fd7-d449-8546-613a0ae9aaff"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {
    PaneBox["\<\"what becomes physically real is constrained by which \
relational distinctions can be recursively stabilized under scale, geometry, \
and closure.\"\>",
     BaseStyle->{"Text", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
         GrayLevel[0.35], 
         GrayLevel[0.8602474]]},
     ImageMargins->5,
     ImageSize->{Full, Automatic}]}
  },
